      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start but it feels a little bit too formal? can you make it sound a bit more \"human\" and warm? maybe acknowledge that sometimes weird things just happen in logistics chains that are out of our control, so it doesn't sound like we're just a faceless corporation.",
